 you can yes  i know you do credit counseling you have  clients what are you hearing from them  these days  people are in panic right now they are  worried that they cannot support their  lifestyle right now they're concerned  that the income is not enough  for their current living expenses they  are panicking  it's anxiety is very high in my job  right now when i talk to my clients and  what do you what do you tell them to try  to calm them  well a little bit of old school things  like meal planning i know it's cliche  again but it really makes a big  difference look for the sales in the  supermarket buy in bulk if you can  um one thing that my husband and i do we  usually shop every week but once every  quarter we don't and that  we save about two hundred dollars by not  shopping for that one week we just shop  what we have in the house use what we  have and that really adds up to about  eight hundred dollars a year  makes a difference sure does those are  useful tips pamela george a financial  counselor in ottawa thank you  thank you so much for having me love her  advice kinship with the queen next what  prince harry said about his grandmother  that's raising questions  the royal cavalry was rehearsing in  london's hyde park in advance of the  royal windsor horse show next month  always a highlight of queen elizabeth's  calendar she turns 96 tomorrow a  milestone she'll mark out of the  spotlight at a farmhouse on her country  estate of sandringham a favorite spot of  her late husband prince philip she has  appeared more frail after he died and  has cut back on some royal duties  because of mobility issues now news of a  surprise visit from her grandson prince  harry and his wife megan last week is  making headlines in an interview with  nbc harry made some cryptic comments  about making sure the queen is protected  it was just so nice to see her you know  she's on she's ungrateful and always  she's always got a great sense of humor  with me and i'm just making 